# Presentation pass for the Workshop screenshots in 16-publication-shots.feature.
#
# It stages the Sanctuary save (Nelims-tribe-decor-mods-z3) with the mods that save needs, the same set as
# SanctuaryBacklot's wsl-deps.sanctuary.map, plus ScreenshotMode and SanctuaryBacklot (the named places). Kept apart from every functional set on
# purpose: store-page pictures should show Contented Livestock in the Sanctuary, and no functional scenario
# is allowed to acquire a scenic-fixture dependency by accident.
